{"title":"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">2021 Fall AMC 10A #1</a> and <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2021 Fall AMC 12A #1</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Laws_of_Exponents)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Laws of Exponents)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Difference_of_Squares)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Difference of Squares)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Estimate)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Estimate)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Simple_and_Quick)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Simple and Quick)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/6/9d69af92dcf1cddc4ee65f39014b5b5c26a1a339.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(2112-2021)^2}{169}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"122\" height=\"41\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/6/d16dd681142d5811a4452018469e7f26fb0663a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 7 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 21 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 49 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 64 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"392\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Laws_of_Exponents.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Laws_of_Exponents)\">Solution 1 (Laws of Exponents)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Laws of Exponents)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/704a7253fd5b1d77107061770699bfe555788438.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(2112-2021)^2}{169}=\\frac{91^2}{169}=\\frac{91^2}{13^2}=\\left(\\frac{91}{13}\\right)^2=7^2=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 49}.\\]\" width=\"441\" height=\"46\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Difference_of_Squares.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Difference_of_Squares)\">Solution 2 (Difference of Squares)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Difference of Squares)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/9/dc9593dd40678e9ec5ad0d3214453ca6227a76c9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(2112-2021)^2}{169}=\\frac{91^2}{169}=\\frac{(10^2-3^2)^2}{13^2}=\\frac{((10+3)(10-3))^2}{13^2}=\\frac{(13\\cdot7)^2}{13^2}=\\frac{13^2 \\cdot 7^2}{13^2}=7^2=\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 49}.\\]\" width=\"772\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Estimate.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Estimate)\">Solution 3 (Estimate)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Estimate)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/6/c264ce3097cd51606aaaccb2e34493be9613d5f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2112-2021 = 91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" />. Approximate this as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> as it is pretty close to it. Also, approximate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/2/3629b1f1f3b22f1a3c927c7ac0467574394f17ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$169$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/6/8066ce3115c8a4f144f69b4cffd01d33c402419b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$170$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />. We then have \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/9/059ba0d910711e20cd3185bc352538e607caec13.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(2112 - 2021)^2}{169} \\approx \\frac{100^2}{170} \\approx \\frac{1000}{17} \\approx 58.\\]\" width=\"292\" height=\"39\" />\nNow check the answer choices. The two closest answers are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/c/34c8e6bf4d57cd6f2bb0d7d43e00f0f442f53b84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e228ac5bee7b9ffb60cacf50f3f2c7c31f8038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />. As the numerator is actually bigger than it should be, it should be the smaller answer, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b68f50ee8aec15c6f90b654420e8e26fb2c5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 49}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/sqjFA_CJNRc\">https://youtu.be/sqjFA_CJNRc</a>\n</p><p>~Charles3829\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Simple_and_Quick.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Simple_and_Quick)\">Video Solution (Simple and Quick)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Simple and Quick)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/wBf2Un_4fjA\">https://youtu.be/wBf2Un_4fjA</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jSvTHKTkod8\">https://youtu.be/jSvTHKTkod8</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>for AMC 10: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/o98vGHAUYjM\">https://youtu.be/o98vGHAUYjM</a>\n</p><p>for AMC 12: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jY-17W6dA3c\">https://youtu.be/jY-17W6dA3c</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3qohnl543-4\">https://youtu.be/3qohnl543-4</a>\n</p><p>~Lucas\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A\">2021 Fall AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_Fall_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2021 Fall AMC 12A Problems/Problem